{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11411030","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11411030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1141103001:1":{"text":"もし生まれる場所を選べるなら、こんな荒れ果てた砂漠なんて誰も選ばないよ。","source_cn":"如果可以选降生地的话，谁会选在这光秃秃的沙海呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE8B54FE95C5D70E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1141103002:1":{"text":"ひどい気候に食糧不足、強い獲物……ここは人が住める場所じゃないよ。","source_cn":"恶劣的天气，匮乏的食物，强悍的猎物，这里并不是一个宜居之地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5323834879AD75A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141103003:1":{"text":"特に弱い人にとってはかなり生きづらい土地だけど、ここから逃げることもできないんだ。","source_cn":"尤其是对于弱者来说，这里很难生存，但他们又都逃离不了这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0BBD68CF05192F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1141103003":{"text":"特に弱い人にとってはかなり生きづらい土地だけど、ここから逃げることもできないんだ。","source_cn":"尤其是对于弱者来说，这里很难生存，但他们又都逃离不了这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0BBD68CF05192F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1141103004:1":{"text":"はは、君たちは不思議に思うかもしれないけど、ここは僕たちを守ってくれる場所でもあるんだ。","source_cn":"哈，说出来你们也许会觉得奇怪，但这里也是我们的庇护所。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B77361091842CB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1141103005:1":{"text":"ババリアにはこんな言葉がある。「砂嵐の中で育った子どもは、砂嵐に愛されてもいる」って。","source_cn":"蛮血们有句流传很广的话，在沙暴中长大的孩子，也被沙暴钟爱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE8012862837E6E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1141103005":{"text":"ババリアにはこんな言葉がある。「砂嵐の中で育った子どもは、砂嵐に愛されてもいる」って。","source_cn":"蛮血们有句流传很广的话，在沙暴中长大的孩子，也被沙暴钟爱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE8012862837E6E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1141103006:1":{"text":"危険っていうのは、時に人を守ってくれるものなんだ。","source_cn":"危险，有的时候也能保护人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB34BB1FD0CE6CFFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1141103007:1":{"text":"荒涼の砂漠で育った子どもは幸せじゃないかもしれないけど、僕たちはここで不屈の精神と逆境に負けない闘争心を手に入れた。","source_cn":"在荒角沙漠长大的孩子也许并不幸福，但相对的，我们拥有坚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8ED4B38F6B6F5F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1141103008:1":{"text":"僕たちはこの世界の一番ひどいところ、もしかしたらその一つかもしれないけど、それを見たことがあるんだから。","source_cn":"我们见过这个世界最糟糕的样子，也许是最糟糕之一……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x810265E813590A3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_rec